1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,840
Editor ho, aur abhi bhi manually captions type karte ho?

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,400
Bhai kis zamaane mein jee rahe ho?

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,120
To aaj main leke aaya hoon aap logon ke liye ek aisi website, jiske upar aap jaake completely free mein captions generate kar sakte ho.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:13,400
Aur iske upar itne saare options hain,

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:18,520
Bilkul Premiere Pro, After Effects level ke captions aap easily generate karwa sakte ho.

6
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,880
To bhai is website ka naam hai Whitestair.

7
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:24,680
Kuch nahi, bas aapko is website pe jaana hai, aapko apni clip upload karni hai.

8
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,520
Aur phir bas ek template choose karna hai.

9
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:31,800
Ye website aapke poore video ka transcript nikalegi aur usi hisaab se captions lagayegi.

10
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,960
Aur phir bas kuch hi minutes mein video export karne ke liye taiyaar.

11
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:38,120
To comment kar do "Captions", link main aapke DM mein bhej dunga.
